cription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":344,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:11:11Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-26T09:26:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T11:08:26Z","closed_at":"2026-08-27T01:39:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122829","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122829","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122829.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122829.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-27T01:39:50Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe function `EditorFileSystem::_scan_filesystem` has a `ScannedDirectory *sd;` object which is either set to a pre-existing object, or set to an object created inside of this function in the `else` branch here:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n\tScannedDirectory *sd;\r\n\tHashSet<String> *processed_files = nullptr;\r\n\t// On the first scan, the first_scan_root_dir is created in _first_scan_filesystem.\r\n\tif (first_scan) {\r\n\t\tsd = first_scan_root_dir;\r\n\t\t// Will be updated on scan.\r\n\t\tResourceUID::get_singleton()->clear();\r\n\t\tResourceUID::scan_for_uid_on_startup = nullptr;\r\n\t\tprocessed_files = memnew(HashSet<String>());\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\tRef<DirAccess> d = DirAccess::create(DirAccess::ACCESS_RESOURCES);\r\n\t\tsd = memnew(ScannedDirectory); // <- here\r\n\t\tsd->full_path = \"res://\";\r\n\t\tnb_files_total = _scan_new_dir(sd, d);\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut then, this instance is not cleaned up, it is simply leaked. This PR fixes the leak.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI used AI to find the problem by telling it to fix memory leaks in godot-dimensions. Once found, the changes are from me.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122829/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122829/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}